    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a vast world filled with mysterious creatures and thrilling battles! In Tokiros, you take on the role of a Hunter, a skilled adventurer exploring wild lands in search of legendary creatures. Capture, train, and evolve your team of unique monsters, each with their own abilities and traits, to form the perfect squad.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and Capture:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through enchanted forests, desolate deserts, dark caves, and candy cities to catch rare and powerful creatures. Use your skills to capture tokiros before they escape!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical Battles:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your enemies in intense battles where strategy and knowledge of your creatures' abilities are key. Combine special attacks, defend against your opponents' weaknesses, and emerge victorious.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests and Events:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete epic missions and face formidable bosses in a dynamic world full of events. Prove you're the best summoner!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Story:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets behind the world of creatures and unravel a plot full of mysteries, alliances, and unexpected enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a fan of creature capture and strategic battle games, Tokiros offers a unique experience of exploration and combat that will keep you playing for hours!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a vast world filled with mysterious creatures and thrilling battles! In Tokiros, you take on the role of a Hunter, a skilled adventurer exploring wild lands in search of legendary creatures. Capture, train, and evolve your team of unique monsters, each with their own abilities and traits, to form the perfect squad.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and Capture:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through enchanted forests, desolate deserts, dark caves, and candy cities to catch rare and powerful creatures. Use your skills to capture tokiros before they escape!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical Battles:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your enemies in intense battles where strategy and knowledge of your creatures' abilities are key. Combine special attacks, defend against your opponents' weaknesses, and emerge victorious.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests and Events:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete epic missions and face formidable bosses in a dynamic world full of events. Prove you're the best summoner!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Story:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets behind the world of creatures and unravel a plot full of mysteries, alliances, and unexpected enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a fan of creature capture and strategic battle games, Tokiros offers a unique experience of exploration and combat that will keep you playing for hours!</p>",
    "short_description": "In Tokiros, explore a vast world full of unique creatures to capture and train! Build your team, face enemies in challenging tactical battles. Discover secrets, complete epic quests, and prove you're the best summoner in this exciting capture and combat game!",
